# Every committed blob and every fresh checkout is LF, overriding a user's
# core.autocrlf. Windows generators (NuGet's packages.lock.json) may transiently
# write CRLF into the working tree; that normalizes back to LF on commit.
# The format gate (.editorconfig end_of_line = lf) and hooks/pre-commit both
# depend on the checkout being LF: CRLF would fail the former and break the
# latter under sh.
* text=auto eol=lf
